// Source of the `iron-smelter` kit (tools/town/kits/iron-smelter.json): the centre-east iron smelter (#3244), the plant the
// iron chain ends at. The host is the works workshop (Workshop_02_grey) of the compound; every row stands on the open apron in
// front of its door (kit frame: the building's own, +z is the door side, rows rest on probed ground, `town fit --terrain`).
// The furnace is the pack LF_IronSmelter.et (machine `smelter-iron`: 2 iron nuggets and 1 coal make a bar, SMELTING level 8), the
// sign def `iron-smelter` is in the pack's Configs/Signs/LF_Signs_Everon1989/LF_Signs_IronSmelter.conf. The coal pile, hopper
// and truck bay are dressing from the `mine-coal-pile`, `mine-hopper` and `mine-truck-bay` kits (props only until the feed-from-truck
// station, #4191, exists). The furnace stands at 1.7x with a brick stack (the vanilla ruined-house chimney at 0.8x) behind it.
